msgstr "Sobre o Auto Focus Keyword for SEO"

#: admin/views/settings.view.php:27
#: premium/auto-focus-keyword-for-seo-premium/admin/views/settings.view.php:15
msgid ""
"The Automatic Focus keyword for SEO plugin will add automatically \"focus "
"keywords\" on the backend, for websites using Yoast SEO, Rank Math, "
"SEOPress, or All in One SEO plugins, to all your pages, based on post titles "
"(used for each of these pages) so that you can optimize your content using "
"their dynamic live settings (meta title, meta description, slug, alt "
"tags, ...) for SEO. Please refer to the FAQ section to learn about all these "
"terms (Focus Keyword, Meta tag Keyword, etc.). Once done, you will be able "
"to use several other plugins made by Pagup.com to automatically optimize Alt "
"tags, Title tags, Internal links and more ... (as these plugins are based on "
"these Focus keywords). Enjoy !"
msgstr ""
"O plugin Automatic Focus Keyword for SEO adicionará automaticamente \"palavr"
"as-chave de foco\" no painel administrativo, para sites que usam Yoast SEO, "
"Rank Math, SEOPress ou All in One SEO, em todas as suas páginas, com base no"
"s títulos dos posts. Assim, você poderá otimizar seu conteúdo usando as conf"
"igurações dinâmicas desses plugins, como meta title, meta description, slug,"
" tags alt e muito mais. Consulte a seção de FAQ para entender esses termos. "
"Depois disso, você poderá usar outros plugins da Pagup.com para otimizar aut"
"omaticamente tags alt, atributos title, links internos e muito mais, pois es"
"ses plugins se baseiam nessas palavras-chave de foco. Aproveite!"

